  "result": "All work is complete! Here's a summary of the three features implemented and fully tested:\n\n## Summary - Invoice Enhancements Complete\n\n\u2705 **All 114 tests passing**\n\n### Feature 1: Line Discounts\n- Lines accept `discountPercent` (0-100, decimals allowed)\n- Discount calculated as: `lineTotal \u00d7 discountPercent / 100` (rounded per line)\n- Validation: `DISCOUNT_INVALID` error for out-of-range/non-numeric values\n\n### Feature 2: Customer Tier-Based Discounts  \n- `TIER_DISCOUNTS` exported from customers.js: gold 5%, silver 2.5%, standard 0%\n- Automatically applied when line has no explicit `discountPercent`\n- Explicit `discountPercent` (even 0) always overrides tier discount\n\n### Feature 3: VAT Calculation\n- `lineVat()` function: VAT calculated on amount **after discount**\n- Formula: `(lineTotal - lineDiscount) \u00d7 vatRate / 100` (rounded per line)\n- `invoiceTotals()` returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, total }`\n- Total = subtotal - discount + vat (never below 0)\n- `renderInvoiceText()` displays subtotal, discount, and VAT lines above total\n\n**Files updated:**\n- src/errors.js (added DISCOUNT_INVALID)\n- src/customers.js (added TIER_DISCOUNTS)\n- src/invoices.js (lineDiscount, lineVat, updated invoiceTotals, createInvoice, addLine)\n- src/render.js (VAT display)\n- test/invoices.test.js (updated 4 tests, added 16 new tests)\n- test/render.test.js (updated 1 test, added 4 new tests)\n\nReady to commit all three features together.",
